OL,3,GNEWSAAttacks victim's death
OL,4,A'potentially preventable'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe death of a student killed in the
OL,7,FNottingham attacks was "potentially
OL,8,Fpreventable", a public inquiry has
OL,9,Fheard.
OL,11,FBarnaby Webber - along with Grace
OL,12,FO'Malley-Kumar and Ian Coates - were
OL,13,Fkilled by Valdo Calocane, who had been
OL,14,Fdiagnosed with paranoid schizophrenia
OL,15,Fin 2020, on 13 June 2023.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
PN,36802
SC,0002
