OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1788882969
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAAttacks victim's death
OL,4,A'potentially preventable'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Tuesday, ahead of closing statements
OL,7,Fto the Nottingham Inquiry - which is
OL,8,Fexamining the killings - the inquiry
OL,9,Fwas told a "more rapid administration
OL,10,Fof blood products" could have meant
OL,11,FBarnaby's death was "potentially
OL,12,Fpreventable".
OL,14,FThe inquiry also heard documents found
OL,15,Fin a bin at Calocane's address
OL,16,Fcontained a list of explosives, which
OL,17,Fwas not disclosed by Nottinghamshire
OL,18,FPolice until June this year.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
